        "subject": "LU-20875 ptlrpc: let be less strict for max frags",
        "message": "LU-20875 ptlrpc: let be less strict for max frags\n\nThe server might reduce the maximum bulk size after the initial\nconnection, and this could cause large extents to be created\nand prepared for sending. Therefore, it might exceed the current\nlimit. Let's make the bulk size checking less strict.\n\nFixes: e1ac9e74 (\"LU-10157 ptlrpc: fill md correctly.\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nHPe-bug-id: LUS-13418\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Lyashkov <alexey.lyashkov@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I66a3956a607074bb2938f109811c321375b8fd28\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
